Encoding: UTF-8
Package: covr2
Title: Simplified Test Coverage for Packages
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Munoz Tord", email = "david.munoztord@mailbox.org", role = c("cre")),
    person("Jim", "Hester", role = "cph",
           comment = "Author of original covr functions"),
    )
Description: Track and report code coverage for your package and (optionally)
    upload the results to a coverage service like 'Codecov' <https://about.codecov.io> or
    'Coveralls' <https://coveralls.io>. Code coverage is a measure of the amount of
    code being exercised by a set of tests. It is an indirect measure of test
    quality and completeness. This package is compatible with any testing
    methodology or framework and tracks coverage of both R code and compiled
    C/C++/FORTRAN code.
URL: https://munoztd0.github.io/covr2, https://github.com/munoztd0/covr2
